#: ../ui.py:445
msgid ""
"Choose a backup.\n"
"This will delete autoinstall list.\n"
"Do you really want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Zvolte zálohu.\n"
"Tímto se smaže autoinstall.\n"
"Opravdu chcete pokračovat?"

